Update GeneformerPretrainer for the Trainer sampler API used by recent Transformers releases.

Transformers 4.57 passes the training dataset to _get_train_sampler, while Geneformer still
implements the older no-argument interface. Accept the dataset argument and use it consistently
when constructing the sampler. Also replace the deprecated Trainer.tokenizer access with
Trainer.processing_class.

Author: Pavel Tomanek (Inuits/UGent) with help from ChatGPT5.6
